192"><div class="elm text-edit gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs" data-exc=""><p style="text-align: inherit!important;">Diversify income streams and increase earnings</p></div></div></div></li><li style="margin-bottom: 3px"><span class="gf-il-icon item-content" data-index="5" data-key="content" style="width: 33px"><div data-label="Icon" data-ver="2" id="e-1675012546283" class="element-wrap" data-id="1675012546283"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-exc=""><div class="gf_icon-wrap"><svg fill="currentColor" height="100%" class="gf_icon" icon-class="bootstrap-regular-bookmark-check-fill" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2 15.5V2a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v13.5a0.5 0.5 0 0 1 -0.74 0.439L8 13.069l-5.26 2.87A0.5 0.5 0 0 1 2 15.5zm8.854 -9.646a0.5 0.5 0 0 0 -0.708 -0.708L7.5 7.793 6.354 6.646a0.5 0.5 0 1 0 -0.708 0.708l1.5 1.5a0.5 0.5 0 0 0 0.708 0l3 -3z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></span><div class="gf-il-content item-content" data-index="5" data-key="content1" style="padding-left: 33px"><div data-label="Text Block" id="e-1675012546371" class="element-wrap" data-id="1675012546371"><div class="elm text-edit gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs" data-exc=""><p style="text-align: inherit!important;">Showcase as CPD plus access further courses</p></div></div></div></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1675012546259" class="gf_row gf_row-gap-12" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1675012546259" data-extraclass="" data-row-gap="12px"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1675009611394" data-id="1675009611394"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1675012546300" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1675012546300"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h2 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2"><u>What is Boxercise?</u></h2></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1675012546361" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1675012546361"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><font color="#005199"><b>Boxercise is an innovative concept of exercise based on training methods which are used by real Boxers. Such sessions could incorporate pad-work or focus on technique or footwork - but never actually hitting an opponent! Boxercise is designed to be enjoyable, safe and inclusive as it can be adapted for different populations.</b></font></p><p></p></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1720094151916" class="gf_row gf_row-gap-12" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1720094151916" data-extraclass="" data-row-gap="12px"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1675009611394" data-id="1675009611394"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1720094151838" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1720094151838"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h2 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2"><u>What will I learn on a Boxercise Course?</u></h2></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1720094151872" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1720094151872"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><font color="#005199"><b>In a Boxercise course you will cover how to safely and effectively design and deliver a Boxercise exercise session. For Personal Trainer's this could involve incorporating Boxercise into a PT session or for Group Instructors it could mean leading a specific Boxercise class. The course covers the use of Boxercise equipment (i.e. pads, gloves etc) and has a firm emphasis on coaching optimal technique for punching, padwork skills and footwork.</b></font></p><p></p></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1720425890131" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1720425890131" data-layout-lg="3+6+3" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="3+6+3" data-layout-sm="12+12+12" data-layout-xs="12+12+12"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-3 gf_col-md-3 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1720425890160" data-id="1720425890160"></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1720425900970" data-id="1720425900970"><div data-label="Youtube" data-key="youtube" data-atomgroup="module" id="m-1720425871363" class="module-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-youtube" data-ver="1" data-id="1720425871363"><div class="module gf_module- " data-url="https://youtu.be/CiMhuQ6Ev0c" data-width="" data-height="" data-responsive="1" data-sound="0" data-autoplay="0" data-loop="0" data-controls="1" data-showinfo="" data-modestbranding="0" data-fs="1" data-rel="" data-hd="" data-start="" data-end=""></div><div class="gf_youtube-overlay"></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-3 gf_col-md-3 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1720512083100" data-id="1720512083100"></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1720095650517" class="gf_row gf_row-gap-12" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1720095650517" data-extraclass="" data-row-gap="12px"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1675009611394" data-id="1675009611394"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1720095650597" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1720095650597"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h2 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2"><u>How can I study a Boxercise course?</u></h2></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1720095650579" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1720095650579"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><br></p><p><font color="#005199"><b>1) Face to face workshop, which is usually around eight hours long at one of 13 nationwide venues. Equipment (pads, gloves etc is provided) and assessment is on the day</b></font></p><p><font color="#005199"><b><br></b></font></p><p><font color="#005199"><b>2) Zoom - here you will spend a day (usually 10:00 to 18:30) on a Zoom webinar with a Boxercise coach - you will need your own gloves/pads for this as there will be a live, virtual assessment</b></font></p><p><font color="#005199"><b><br></b></font></p><p><font color="#005199"><b>3) Distance Learning - this is study via an online course which includes six hours of video content. You will need to source own equipoment for a video assessment.</b></font></p><p><font color="#005199"><b><br></b></font></p><p><font color="#005199"><b>There are 8-9 CIMSPA CPD points available depending on the chosen delivery method</b></font></p><p><font color="#005199"><b><br></b></font></p><p><font color="#005199"><strong>Boxercise courses are usually £149.00 however by completing the below form (exclusive for Study Active Graduates) you will recieve a </strong><strong>10% discount when you use the code Box@StudyA@10x31 (valid until 31st July 2024)</strong></font></p><p></p></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Separator" data-key="separator" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1674911448648" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-separator" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1674911448648"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-align="left" data-exc=""><hr class="gf_separator"></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Hero Banner" data-key="hero-banner" data-atomgroup="module" id="m-1675017655329" class="module-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-herobanner" data-ver="1.1" data-id="1675017655329"><div class="module " data-image="https://ucarecdn.com/2f6dca3e-8079-4a66-aa31-4a48b4be183e/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/boxercise-footerimage-1920x800.jpg" data-image-lg="https://ucarecdn.com/2f6dca3e-8079-4a66-aa31-4a48b4be183e/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/boxercise-footerimage-1920x800.jpg" data-image-md="https://ucarecdn.com/39511b0c-b154-4d0d-be10-96f551755850/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/hero%20banner.png" data-image-sm="https://ucarecdn.com/39511b0c-b154-4d0d-be10-96f551755850/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/hero%20banner.png" data-image-xs="https://ucarecdn.com/f0656f15-607b-4864-b81e-9f20d35e5e58/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/header-mob-hi-tinted-375x400.jpg" data-height="" data-effect="none" data-transition="0.5" data-fixedmode="0"><span data-index="1" class="item-content align-middle"><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1675017655436" class="gf_row gf_row-fluid gf_row-no-padding gf_row-gap-0" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1675017655436" data-layout-lg="6+6" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="7+5" data-layout-sm="8+4" data-layout-xs="12+12" data-row-gap="0px"><div c